<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-COPA AMERICA LEADING GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COPA AMERICA LEADING GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Bolivia 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Copa America soccer tournament after Thursday's games.</p>
<p>5-Luis Hernandez (Mexico)</p>
<p>2-Ronaldo (Brazil), Neider Morrantes (Colombia), Ariel Graziani (Ecuador), Marcelo Gallardo (Argentina), Paul Cominges (Peru), Julio Cesar Baldivieso (Bolivia)</p>
</text>
